A('1964-0205-songthan', '1964-02-05', VH, 'Bến Tre. Saigon\'s operation Sóng Thần 5 on the Thạnh Phú coast, its largest since the marines\' sweep of March 1960, ends Feb. 5 after 17 days against Region 8\'s Battalion 263, a Bến Tre company, a Thạnh Phú platoon and the trainees of the schools: 1,240 of the Saigon side out of action, many aircraft shot down.', 'III, 346–47', place='thanh-phu', also=OP, check='the start, 17 days before, about Jan. 19; the figures as the history gives them.')
