A('1964-0408-caydiep', '1964-04-08', VH, 'Bến Tre. The night of Apr. 8 the province\'s sapper company destroys the Cây Điệp junction post, held by a Civil Guard platoon, and besieges the An Thạnh post, to draw out Saigon\'s 1st ("Yellow Eagle") Battalion of the 12th Regiment.', 'III, 347', place='cay-diep', band_='night', also=OP)
